cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mnimi, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "mnimi: embeddable, local-first agent memory"
abstract: "An embeddable, local-first agent-memory library: one SQLite file via sqlite-vec, two core dependencies, no server. The write side extracts, deduplicates, resolves conflicts and decays; the read side ranks under logical time with no LLM. The library the paper describes is the tag paper-v1."
